        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1619] The message \"AC_ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes\" shall contain the ResponseCode \"FAILED_WrongChargeParameter\" if the content of attribute \"EV_EnergyTransferParameter\" in the AC_ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq message is not valid, for example, wrong parameter set is provided, one or multiple parameters cannot be interpreted.",
